mapping "D760A.1" source="D760A" target="4278365" relationship=equivalent {
    confidence 4 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
    comment "en" """
        Swedish fifth-char extension A = first episode of Langerhans cell histiocytosis; base ICD10CM
        D76.0 is invalid since 2009 with no ICD10CM successor, so the standard SNOMED CT concept 4278365
        (65399007) carries the claim; episode marker preserved as custom. Target replaces invalid
        ICD10CM 35206793 (D76.0); target system upgrade ICD10CM -> SNOMED CT.
        """
}
